+# Epic 23: Plugin Framework Foundation
+
+## Overview
+
+Establish the unified plugin framework that enables all Axiathon extension points -- ingestion sources, protocol dissectors, notification channels, and response actions -- to use a single SDK, manifest format, packaging system, and lifecycle management. All MVP data sources are implemented as first-party plugins through this framework.
+
+**Priority:** P1
+**Repo:** axiathon
+**Stories:** 14 (67 points)
+
+## Planning Documents
+
